{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>The blood of My sacrifices.</b> It is the slaughter of the festival of Passover, which is eaten with unleavened bread and bitter herbs." "<b>The fat of My festival.</b> It is a blameless lamb, which is an obligation. And so it is written: \"at the time of raising the burnt offering and the fats\" (II Chronicles 35:14) until morning."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {1 "Reading חיוב (obligation); some witnesses may read differently."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:40.194514656Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}